@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Anomaly Detection Settings" as SAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: Access Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Receive News Related to Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: View Consolidated Financial Dashboard" as CFR010
  usecase "SAFR003: Manage Client Data Access for Advisors" as SAFR004
  
  usecase "FAFR001: Schedule Mentoring Sessions Based on Insights" as FAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "FAFR003: Review Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "SAFR005: Configure Analysis Parameters by Client Segment" as SAFR006

  usecase "SFR001: Deliver Alerts Through Notification Channels" as SFR001
  usecase "SFR002: Generate Personalized Recommendations" as SFR002
  usecase "AIFR001: Analyze Historical Data for Predictions" as AIFR001
  usecase "AIFR004: Identify Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as AIFR005

  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback to Improve System Outputs" as CFR012
  
}

actor Client as C
actor FinancialAdvisor as FA
actor SysAdmin as SA
actor User as U

Client --> CFR001 : View dashboard with financial data.
C -> SAFR002 : Adjust anomaly detection settings (for client).
Client -->> SFR003 : Request predictions from AI system.
Client -->> AIFR008 : Receive spending limit alerts when thresholds are exceeded.

User -->> FAFR001 : Schedule mentoring sessions based on insights generated by the system.
FA --> FAFR002 : Review intervention alerts for clients.
FA --> FAFR003 : Analyze predictive analytics provided to advisors during consultations.

SysAdmin -> SAFR004 : Manage client data access settings (for advisors).
SA -->> SFR005 : Request analysis parameter configurations by segment from the system.

SFR001 <|-- C : Notify user of critical financial events.
SFR002 <|-- FA: Provide personalized recommendations to advisor for clients.
AIFR004 <|-- SA: Identify investment opportunities based on risk profiles and client segments.

Client -->> SFR008 : Request anomaly transaction alerts from the system.
C -> AIFR006 : Receive spending limit alerts when thresholds are breached by user's expenses.
Client --> CFR012 : Send feedback to improve recommendations and insights (for all users).

@enduml